Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:36.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(141,66)}Episode{\c&H8065C7&} 12       {\c&H020201} {\c&HA49F43&}Local Cleaning {\c&H020201&}with a Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:49.27,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Um, may I ask you to take care of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:51.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:55.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. \NPlease allow me to inspect the garment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.87,0:01:59.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You two sure are dressed up today. \NAre you going somewhere together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.60,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Yes, to Izu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:05.02,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,To stay the night! \NI'm going to take a bunch of pictures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:09.29,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,and draw sketches of capybaras, \Ncrocodiles, and bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:12.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Do those things go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:16.01,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I'll bring you back a souvenir, \Nso please expect something nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:16.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.07,0:02:26.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A trip sounds nice. I'd love to go \Nsomewhere far away for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.92,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Are you plotting to skip town, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:30.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ah! Aji-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.80,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Yeah, just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:36.29,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.56,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Take care of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.56,0:02:43.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. Allow me to \Ninspect your items at the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:46.86,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Again? It's the same stuff as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:50.44,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,You don't need to check every \Nsingle time. For crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:54.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, I must! No matter how carefully \Nyou handle your clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:59.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,they may become worn or discolored, \Nor stretch or shrink over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:04.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Buttons and seams can unravel, and you \Nmight have stains that aren't easy to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:07.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That is why I must check \Nevery single time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:09.11,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:10.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to come across as pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:17.47,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Fine, then. Do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:29.86,sign_4843_31_Orders_will_be_r,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFCFDFD&\bord2}Orders will be ready\N{\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\pos(105,224)}on the {\c&H9C9DE3&\b1\fs24}26th
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:26.62,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,How long has it been since \Nyou set up here. Two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:27.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.86,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:34.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And you're still using \Nthe same old ironing table.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:39.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I am. I try to take good care of \Nthe equipment passed down to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:42.89,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're able to \Nmake use of such an antique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:46.43,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's all because you maintained \Neverything, Aji-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:50.75,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I didn't maintain a thing. \NI just left it all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:56.26,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:04:02.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, Aji-san, excuse me, but would you \Nmind if I asked you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:05.28,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,What now? Is it about the rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:19.03,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Fine, then. If it's that much of a hassle,\N I'll just wash it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I simply wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:36.01,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:40.01,sign_4843_31_Orders_will_be_r,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFCFDFD&\bord2\frz346.8\pos(67,176)\fax0.26}Orders will be ready\N{\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\pos(105,224)}on the {\c&H7175CC&\b1\fs24}8th
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:38.97,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,And he ran off without saying a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:40.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:48.34,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Kyusho-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:53.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wonder if I did something \Nto make him uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:56.38,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Of course not. Don't even worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:58.29,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I'm sure he was just embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:04:59.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.71,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Well, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:03.95,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,We're talking about a boy who's still \Nmaking his way through puberty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:06.06,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:08.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wonder if you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:11.79,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I am. So you don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:21.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\shad0\fnArial\c&H3A3E47&\3c&H7994E1&}Kinme
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:33.23,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,690)\pos(51,122)\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE3DBD5&\pos(321,128)\fs24}Timer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:31.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\pos(321,128)\fs30}Start
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:31.34,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\fs30\pos(323,263)}Pause
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:39.78,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H5E6568&\3c&HC5D7DF&\fs26\pos(329,201)\fad(1103,1)}We are closed for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:50.79,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H8ABDDD&\move(304,30,304,23,0,2977)}September Rent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:50.79,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H84B6D6&\fs12\move(311,311,311,321)}Kinme Wak{\3c&H6094B7&}ana\N{\3c&H84B6D6&}Kinme Cle{\3c&H6094B7&}aning
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:54.47,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,She usually comes to pick it up \Nat the end of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:06:01.14,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\fad(393,1)}Um, Aji-san, excuse me but would you \Nmind if I asked you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:03.93,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,What now? Is it about the rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:08.93,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, Aji-san, how have you \Nbeen feeling recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:11.45,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:16.88,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,You know what I say. \NI've always been healthy as a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:17.69,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:23.10,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,I noticed something similar the last time \Nyou brought your laundry in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:28.20,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,but there appears to be a stain \Nin the crotch area I hadn't seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:29.77,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Could this mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.95,0:06:37.46,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,{\t(4071,4488,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Fine, then. If it's that much of a hassle,\N I'll just wash it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:43.36,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I must have offended her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.79,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H8ABDDD&\pos(303,20)}September Rent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H84B6D6&\fs12\pos(315,316)}Kinme Wak{\3c&H6094B7&}ana\N{\3c&H84B6D6&}Kinme Cle{\3c&H6094B7&}aning
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:57.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H70625B&\3c&H93948B&\fs27\an8\frz6.011\pos(284,40)}Away for a moment.\NBe back soon. - Manager
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:11.48,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,So this is Aji-san's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:12.49,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\c&H211914&\3c&H8C8B87&\fnTimes New Roman\b1}Absolutely NO Solicitors\N Door-to-Door Sales Prohibited
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:19.51,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I know she always says she doesn't \Nwant me showing up at her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:35.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Excuse me, please. It's me, Kinme Wakana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.61,0:07:37.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Are you home, Aji-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:41.73,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I wonder if she's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's open?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:52.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Excuse me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's me, Kinme Wakana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Aji-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to catch you \Nwhile you're cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:05.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I went ahead and \Nbrought this month's rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:24.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\fad(895,1)\pos(421,244)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:29.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(421,244)\fad(1,942)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:31.45,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H4E7F37&\3c&HB3D8AA&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\pos(177,262)}We pick up and deliver!\N {\c&H2A433D&\3c&HDEF1DD&\fnArial\b1}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.81,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,All right, move along now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:43.24,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,How am I gonna get \Nany sweeping done? Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:47.71,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I guess all these leaves \Nmean it's finally fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:51.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose it is \Nthat time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:53.95,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Getting out of the house \Nis gonna be a pain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.89,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Boy oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:09:00.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I brought your clean garments for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:01.48,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.91,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I was able to get \Nthe stains out completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:08.11,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Were you now? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:15.38,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sure was embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:19.92,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,All the while, I kept saying, \N"I'm healthy as a horse!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:24.52,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,But you read me like a book and \Nknew what was wrong, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:27.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't put it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:35.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I am very sorry for upsetting you, though.\N I should not have spoken so carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:43.52,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,It's all right. If you hadn't been worried\N about me, I might not have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:51.70,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,When I felt myself starting to pass out, \NI thought that was it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:57.35,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I should've listened to your warning \Nand gotten checked at the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:10:00.04,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,instead of ignoring it \Nuntil I ended up collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:06.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call it a warning. I wasn't \Naware of your condition, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:13.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's just, the longer I get to know my \Ncustomers as their neighborhood cleaner,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:18.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I do start to notice when there are \Nslight changes in their garments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:23.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And I'll think, "Oh, it looks like \Nher weight changed a little"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:27.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,or "He must have gone through something \Nthat made him sweat a lot."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:33.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really only wanted to share \Nwith you what I had noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:38.70,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,You're like a criminal profiler, \Nin a manner of speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:40.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Pro-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:43.23,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Well, I just mean to say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:48.70,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,that people who work as cleaners \Nactually have a pretty important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:51.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:56.16,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, your shop is \Ntwo years old now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:58.85,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ah, yes! I couldn't have \Nmade it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:02.90,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Oh boy, I remember how \Nstressful things were at first
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.33,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,when you didn't have many customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:10.15,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I was so afraid that you might not \Nmake rent, it gave me the chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:18.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I was soon able to build a regular \Ncustomer base thanks to your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:22.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You told me that because of all \Nthe hills and stairs in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:25.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,there are elderly folks who can't get \Nto my shop even if they want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:28.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And with all of the winding, narrow roads,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:32.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,it can be tough getting \Naround even in a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,When I heard that, I thought, "Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:39.43,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I need to think of a way to serve \Nthis community's needs."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:41.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:53.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I decided the shop motto should be \N"Local Cleaning with a Heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:02.45,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Seems fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:07.16,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,So, are you planning anything special \Nfor your second anniversary?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:12.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I was thinking of throwing a special \Nsecond anniversary event
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:14.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,to show my appreciation \Nto all of my customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:17.09,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Oh. Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.43,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.43,0:12:25.49,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,When it's too much trouble to leave \Nthe house, I'll give you another call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:28.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure! Whenever you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:33.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Aji-san, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:38.16,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I never expected that it \Nwould be my turn next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:39.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Your turn next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:45.54,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Well, I remembered I'd heard about \Nsomething like this in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:49.78,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,from the cleaning shop \Nthat was in there before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:50.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:56.10,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,The manager then also noticed \Na change in a customer's clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:12:58.94,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,that meant their disease was progressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:02.59,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, \Nthey caught it just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:09.78,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:15.11,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,So the previous cleaner paid \Nattention to things like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:38.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:41.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Yagara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:43.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:47.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You want {\i1}me{\i0} to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.22,Default,Player,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:50.14,Default - Top,Player,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:50.97,Default,Player,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:55.61,Default,Member 1,0,0,0,,Asami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:56.36,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:00.03,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:02.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You sure did, Yagara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fs19\c&H717680&\3c&H3F4D6D&\shad0\fax0.26\frz346\pos(538,28)}Nikko-tei
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs28\an8\fnArial\b1\c&H82732B&\3c&HE2F3F4&}Grand Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:06.99,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Phew! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:10.03,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You sure saved our necks today!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:13.21,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,One of our members got busy \Nwith something at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:17.35,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,But since you stepped in, we were \Nstill able to play a scrimmage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:19.23,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,And you're actually pretty good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:22.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I was just following \Neveryone else's lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:26.38,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I always knew you'd be good at sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:29.90,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,We barely taught you anything and \Nyou're already playing like a regular.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:32.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.77,Default,Member 1,0,0,0,,We'd love it if you joined formally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:38.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not even married yet, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:41.58,Default,Member 1,0,0,0,,You're still young, so I bet you \Ndon't even get sore muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:46.62,Default,Member 2,0,0,0,,Yeah, if I don't cool down afterwards, \NI'm stiff as a board the next day!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:49.54,Default,Member 2,0,0,0,,I wish I could work out \Nas much as Yagara-chan does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.75,Default,Member 3,0,0,0,,Yagara-chan, show us that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:56.48,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Working on this is just a hobby of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:59.44,Default,Member 3,0,0,0,,Just {\i1}look{\i0} at those abs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:00.58,Default,Member,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.64,Default,Member 4,0,0,0,,You're in great shape too, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:11.34,Default,Member 4,0,0,0,,Your skin is so supple. \NI can't help but be jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:10.53,Default - Top,Member,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:12.36,Default - Top,Member,0,0,0,,And so firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:13.96,Default,Member 2,0,0,0,,Hey, let me feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:19.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll return the uniform \Nafter I've washed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.18,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,No, you can keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:22.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.96,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Save it for the next time \NI invite you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:28.58,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:29.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:36.79,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, almost forgot. I'll bring you \Nmy husband's suit tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.71,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,So do your usual thing to it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:43.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure. As usual, you can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:45.04,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:51.81,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Well, that was an overwhelming day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:56.16,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,But this is one great way \Nto stay active in the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:04.16,Flashback Italics,Aji,0,0,0,,And you're still using \Nthe same old ironing table.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:11.50,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of person \Nthe previous manager was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\shad1\bord4\c&HAEF0F6&\3c&HA871CC&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fad(398,1)\pos(538,15)}2-Year Anniversary\NDiscount Sale
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HBBF2F7&\frz359.9\fscx73\fscy15\pos(535.5,69)\fad(398,1)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\an8\shad1\c&HA871CC&\3c&HF8F8FA&\4c&HA3CACC&\pos(534,73)}30% {\shad0\b1\3c&HBBF2F7&}Off Coupon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs10\shad0\c&H737161&\3c&HEFE4BC&\pos(535,113)\fad(398,1)}* Please present this flyer when visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HF7F4E9&\frz359.9\fscx74\fscy60\alpha20\pos(535.5,116)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(398,1)\fs10\shad0\3c&HF7F4E9&\c&H636156&\pos(459,121)}Thanks to your support, our business is\Nentering its third year. We continue to\Nfollow our motto to bring you \N"local cleaning with a heart" \Nand will always do our best\Nto make our customers happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\fs10\shad0\3c&HF7F4E9&\c&H636156&\pos(562,194)}Manager: Kinme Wakana
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H9BE8DB&\frz359.9\fscx74\fscy22\pos(535.5,199)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H6FAC5B&\frz359.9\pos(492.5,203)\fscx32\fscy17}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(398,1)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H6FAC5B&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\pos(458,205)}We pick up\Nand deliver!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H323839&\3c&HC3E4DE&\shad0\fnArial\b1\fs18\fad(398,1)\pos(537,201)}Kinme \NCleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.52,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H5B5FBA&\3c&H9FA9E8&}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:46.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good evening! It's Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:48.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I've come to deliver your garments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:50.99,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:56.66,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot. I'm sorta tied up right now,\N so can you leave them by the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:58.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:02.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm doing a second anniversary event, \Nso I'll leave a flyer for that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:06.67,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,It's your second anniversary! \NWell, we'll have to celebrate, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:08.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, that isn't necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:13.39,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh, but I want to! \NYou're always such a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:16.06,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I'll stop by with a present in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:38.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:40.18,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Wakana-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:49.02,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I can tell Konatsu and Dai are thrilled \Nto bump into you this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:51.19,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I am too, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:54.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm flattered. \NI'm happy to see you all too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:59.56,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Oh. I heard from the ladies \Nat the bath house,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:03.02,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,but congratulations on your shop's \Nsecond anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:05.19,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,We should celebrate sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:06.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Celebrate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:10.61,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,This is a big deal, \Nso on your next day off,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:13.20,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,why don't you come over again \Nfor some more homemade cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:17.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:28.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:32.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Who may I help first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:36.38,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all right. \NWe didn't bring any laundry today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:37.27,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:37.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:42.10,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Here. In honor of your second anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.35,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,No, really. Please take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:51.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:54.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:58.26,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Well, it makes us very happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:00.17,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work. We appreciate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.54,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:02.66,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:06.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'll continue to do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:09.16,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,See you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:15.38,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Those are such pretty flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:21.89,sign_4843_31_Orders_will_be_r,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFCFDFD&\bord2\pos(60,206)}Orders will be ready\N{\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\pos(105,224)}on the {\c&H7175CC&\b1\fs24}25th
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:18.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,They're a present \Nfor my shop's anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:21.89,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,But of course! \NOh, I also brought you a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.07,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:27.03,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,It's a second anniversary card!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs16\fnArial\pos(288,239)\c&H878E95&\3c&HFDFDFD&}Kinme-oneesan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs10\fnArial\c&H878E95&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(388,274)}Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs12\fnArial\c&H878E95&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(442,326)}Ka{\3c&HEDEAFA&}takuchi\NNairo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs12\fnArial\c&HC5C98D&\3c&HF5F3FE&\pos(298,333)}Pssht\N{\3c&HEDEAFA&}Pssht
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.40,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:38.66,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Allow me to take a second \Nanniversary picture for publicity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:42.79,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I'll post it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:44.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you for handling all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.66,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:48.67,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Wassup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:50.78,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:53.02,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:54.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:19:57.43,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,We brought this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:19:59.14,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Ready and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:01.80,Default,Kyusho/Kuriru/Moruda,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your \Nsecond anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:04.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:05.08,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:07.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Can I open it right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.06,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.52,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\shad0\fs12\fad(773,1)\pos(320,9)\c&H5A5E99&\3c&HDAF2FC&}2nd Anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.52,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\shad0\fs10\fad(773,1)\c&H5A5E99&\3c&HDAF2FC&\pos(347,53)}Kinme\NCleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:11.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:21.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm so flattered to have you all here \Nto celebrate with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.45,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:26.00,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,No, you already got cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yagara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:31.06,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you can \Nnever have too much cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.52,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You're right about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:33.24,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:34.51,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Who are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.97,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Um... I'm Moruda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:39.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\shad0\fs12\c&H5A5E99&\3c&HDAF2FC&\move(180,6,95,6,0,2977)}2nd Anniversary
