Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:54.36,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs7\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(98.455,263.886)}Riley Dalton\NSriram Gurunathan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:07.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here are your washed garments.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:08.72,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:12.96,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,So how's the second anniversary \Nevent going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:19.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Fine. I thought it would be a nice way to \Nshow my appreciation for my customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:22.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but I ended up receiving \Na bunch of gifts instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:25.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm honestly starting \Nto feel a little guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:29.53,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Why would you feel guilty about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:30.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:37.30,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,It's just a way to show their gratitude \Nfor how considerate you always are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:40.25,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be ashamed to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:42.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:47.58,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me. \NWould you wait right there a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:48.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:53.74,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Here. This one is from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:56.57,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,If you don't need it, \Nyou can toss it for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.87,0:22:03.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.86,0:22:17.39,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,It has already been two years \Nsince I started my shop in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:23.74,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,When I was just starting out, \NI didn't have many regular customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:28.03,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,and there were times \Nwhen I was unsure of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:31.62,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,But over time, people got to \Nknow me and my business better,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.59,0:22:36.35,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,and as a result, \NI've been able to make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:47.21,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,I'll keep striving to live up \Nto my motto to provide
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.21,0:22:50.66,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,"Local Cleaning with a Heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:22:58.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Welcome. I'll get the door right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.10,0:22:59.16,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.09,0:23:02.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is this your first time coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:07.49,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,Yes. Someone in the neighborhood \Nrecommended you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:12.51,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,I think I this got dirty when \NI was out with friends yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:15.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:17.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Please allow me to inspect your item.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.63,0:23:18.72,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:24.32,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,It's a favorite that \Nmy mother bought for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.99,0:23:27.39,Default,Female Customer,0,0,0,,Do you think you can clean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.92,0:23:33.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:39.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad2\c&H0B0A0B&\3c&HDEDEDE&\blur2\bord1\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(446,263)}Thank you for {\c&HB9B539&\3c&H77777D&}watching.
